# Arc's Previews beside a Gmail, Google Calendar or recent-pages favorite (docs/arc-parity.md "Previews, measured"):
# Gmail's card lists the unread mail, 84 pt rows to at most 270 pt with a ＋; with none it is Arc's
# "exhale" card. Calendar's card is today's 255 pt timeline with the gear and ＋.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://debug?gmailPreview=3
expect-log preview card shown: 238x254$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
cra://debug?gmailPreview=9
expect-log preview card shown: 238x270$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
cra://debug?gmailPreview=0
expect-log preview card shown: 240x6[0-9]$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
cra://debug?calendarPreview=1
expect-log preview card shown: 238x255$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
# Recent pages (#376): 36 pt rows to at most 270 pt with room for the ＋; none is Arc's line.
cra://debug?recentPages=linear&pages=2
expect-log preview card shown: 238x115$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
cra://debug?recentPages=figma&pages=12
expect-log preview card shown: 238x270$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
cra://debug?recentPages=notion&pages=0
expect-log preview card shown: 240x[0-9]+$
cra://debug?previewDismiss=1
